{
  "description": "HELD-OUT TEST set (v7) for the second-retrieval-hop milestone. 20 BRIDGE questions (an entity chunk AND a rule/data/code chunk that does not name the entity, require_all; several need 3-4 chunks) and 12 single-chunk lookups as regression controls. Written and committed BEFORE any hop code; the hop is designed on v5/v6 (dev) and run on v7 ONCE. By the AI assistant, who knew a second hop was planned but not its mechanism (not independent). PRE-REGISTERED primary metric: full-coverage recall@5 on bridge questions, vector baseline vs vector + hop, paired sign test. Secondary: lookup MRR@10 and end-to-end correct (qa_v7.json) with production defaults.",
  "kinds": {
    "bridge_rule": "entity chunk + a general rule chunk that never names the entity",
    "bridge_data": "entity chunk + data/waves.json (counts, no shared vocabulary)",
    "bridge_code": "entity chunk + a code or config chunk whose formula or key applies to it",
    "lookup": "one chunk states the answer; a regression control"
  },
